flowchart TB
  accTitle: Moonbase observation and freshness flow
  accDescr: Validate the registry and optional writer slots. Invalid or unreadable input is visibly unavailable. Valid observations join real identities; registry-only identities remain unobserved, while each writer is evaluated independently for stale, stopped, or fresh measured execution state. Resident state includes source coverage.
  File["Registry and optional writer slots"]
  Validate["Validate schema, bounds, and timestamps"]
  Error["Visible unavailable state"]
  Join["Join observations to real identities"]
  None["No observation: unobserved"]
  Age["Evaluate each writer independently"]
  Old["Stale or stopped source"]
  Fresh["Fresh measured execution state"]
  UI["Resident state plus source coverage"]
  File --> Validate
  Validate -->|"Invalid or unreadable"| Error
  Validate -->|"Valid"| Join
  Join -->|"Registry only"| None
  Join -->|"Writer present"| Age
  Age --> Old
  Age --> Fresh
  None --> UI
  Old --> UI
  Fresh --> UI
